{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>ונגש</b>. Nifal pattern, like נצב לריב (Isaiah 3:13). And some say that the nun is a root letter from the heavy doubled pattern." "<b>ירהבו</b>. Like ישלטו וינצחו, like המחצבת רהב (Isaiah 51:9)."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {0 "Resolved הנ\"ון as הנו\"ן (the nun), i.e., the nun in ונגש."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:51:39.435649510Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}